[ti:Rinai Senja]
[ar:Sore Pelan]
[00:06.32]Rinai turun di kaca jendela
[00:12.63]Kopi hangat menemani sore
[00:18.95]Kota pelan menarik napasnya
[00:25.26]Kita diam, tak perlu kata
[00:31.58]Lampu jalan mulai menyala
[00:37.89]Ada tenang di antara kita
[00:44.21]Biar hujan bercerita panjang
[00:50.53]Pulanglah pelan, aku di sini
